<title>FINLAND: SILJA LINE MAY PASSENGERS FALL 0.8 PCT.</title>
<headline>SILJA LINE MAY PASSENGERS FALL 0.8 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish passenger ferry</p>
<p>operator Silja Oy Ab said in a statement on Friday the number of</p>
<p>passengers carried in May by its Baltic Sea operator Silja Line</p>
<p>fell by 0.8 percent year-on-year.</p>
<p>It gave the following figures:</p>
<p> Passenger volume		     May 1997	   May 1996</p>
<p> Helsinki-Stockholm		    120,372	    119,633</p>
<p> Turku-Stockholm			 157,539	    163,787</p>
<p> Vaasa traffic			    78,074	     69,441</p>
<p> Helsinki-Tallinn			 73,259	     87,374</p>
<p> Finnjet				    19,872	     14,654</p>
<p> Aland islands traffic		   6,057		4,086</p>
<p> TOTAL passengers			455,173	    458,975</p>
<p> Cars					 26,801	     26,285</p>
<p> Freight units			    11,484	     11,216</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245,</p>
<p>				e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
